Search the web for ideas that fit, passing focus: "music" to steer toward trusted music sites. Lean on the seed or the tastes already gathered — for a group playlist, look for overlap rather than just averaging everyone's favorites in.

Call present_options to offer two or three directions (different moods, eras, or angles on the seed) — don't write them out as a list in chat. Refine with their feedback until one feels right.

Once a direction's picked, call advance_flow with a note of it, so the next stage can put the playlist together.
